  "description": "Strongly-typed .NET 8 client for the Billy REST API (billy.dk). Supports Bills, Invoices, Contacts, Products, Accounts, Daybooks, BankPayments, and more. Features convention-driven CRUD repositories, partial updates via DeltaObject<T>, opt-in sideloading of related objects, and flexible filtering, sorting, and paging. Extensible: add unlisted Billy endpoints or custom helpers from your own project without modifying this library.",
